  {
    "id": 4001040070430,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………\r\nこの番組、面白かったかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070430"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070440,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "見てる人",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070440"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070450,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070450"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070460,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ファンの人とか……視聴者の人が\r\n選んでくれた企画でしょ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070460"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070470,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だから、番組のタイトルみたいに\r\n企画を通して成長したいなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070470"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070480,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そういう姿を、ここでは\r\n見てもらおうって、思ってたけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070480"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070490,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "結局あんまり\r\n変われてないような気がするし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070490"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070500,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070500"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070510,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070510"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070520,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、そもそも\r\n変わりたいって思ってないからな～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070520"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070530,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "ふふっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070530"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070540,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "いいね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070540"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070550,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今の雛菜だってすっごい良くて～\r\nすきだよ～って人、いるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070550"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070560,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "こうなりなさい～とか、\r\nこれが正しい～って誰かに決められたものになるの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070560"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070570,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "成長っていう～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070570"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070580,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "おー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070580"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070590,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "自分がこういうふうになりたいな～って\r\n思うように、なればいいんじゃないの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070590"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070600,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そうなったとしても、\r\n雛菜はず～っと、雛菜だけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070600"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070610,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そ、そうだよね\r\nでも、わたし────……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070610"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070620,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だから小糸ちゃんが\r\nみんなのなってほしい小糸ちゃんになりたいなら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070620"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070630,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なればいいんじゃない？\r\nこれから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070630"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070640,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070640"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070650,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "小糸ちゃんがどうなりたいかとか\r\n雛菜、知らないけど～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070650"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070660,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "もっとなんか\r\nそういう企画だったらよかったね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070660"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070670,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……この企画のタイトル",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070670"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070680,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "『成長中』で『（仮）』だから\r\n成長しました、とは言ってない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070680"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070690,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、言われてみれば\r\nそ、そうだね……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070690"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070700,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "だから、いいんじゃない\r\n次で",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070700"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070710,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\n雛菜、レギュラー放送がいい～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070710"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070720,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "面白くなかったかもしれないけど～\r\nこれから成長するかもしれないしね～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070720"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070730,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴぇ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070730"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070740,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そ、それでも\r\n次が……あるのかな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070740"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070750,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "……ふふっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070750"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001040070760,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "まー、あったら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400104007/4001040070760"
  },
